   "txt": "**1. Single Most Important Fact**\nTwo Senior Management Personnel (SMP)\u2014Mr. Changhwan Kim (Customer Care & Service Division Leader) and Mr. Yongchan Jung (Chief Production Officer)\u2014will cease to be associated with the company effective from the close of business hours on December 31, 2026, due to relocation back to Korea.\n\n**2. Key Numbers**\n* None stated in the filing (this is an executive management cessation disclosure, not a financial results filing).\n\n**3. Management Guidance, Outlook, or Forward Statements**\n* None provided.\n\n**4. What a Shareholder Should Watch or Act On**\n* Watch for subsequent announcements regarding the appointment of successors for the critical roles of Chief Production Officer (CPO) and Customer Care & Service (CC&S) Division Leader to ensure smooth operational handover.\n\n**5. One-Line Net Read**\n* **Neutral**: Represents a standard corporate rotation/relocation of expatriate senior management back to the Korean parent entity without any adverse operational or governance issues cited."
